DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
42746::$$$message_0350_0000_0000$$$::"Huh. So you've made it this far, Sakura."::
42747::$$$message_0350_0000_0001$$$::"Nee-san... I knew you'd make it here."::
42748::$$$message_0350_0000_0002$$$::"Obviously. I didn't actually face anyone that strong on the way here... Did you fight them all?"::
42749::$$$message_0350_0000_0003$$$::"..."::
42750::$$$message_0350_0000_0004$$$::"Wow. You've got rotten luck, as always."::
42751::$$$message_0350_0000_0005$$$::"I'm going to the onsen, and I'm going to be happy.[wait canskip=0 time=300][hffacechg chara=桜 face=喜 layer=1 time=200] I won't let you stop me."::
42752::$$$message_0350_0000_0006$$$::"You heard her, Rin. But I think you still have the option of yielding to her."::
42753::$$$message_0350_0000_0007$$$::"Huh?"::
42754::$$$message_0350_0000_0008$$$::"Excuse me? [l][hfwww layer=0][say storage=HSAK6_RIN_0050 _name=凛]Just so you know, I never hold back in a battle of magecraft."::
42755::$$$message_0350_0000_0009$$$::"...That's too bad. I thought this could have ended nicely, with a little sister feeling gratitude and admiration for her big sister."::
42756::$$$message_0350_0000_0010$$$::"...Archer.[lr]::
42757::$$$message_0350_0000_0011$$$::I never thought you'd show that kind of concern."::
42758::$$$message_0350_0000_0012$$$::"In the actual war, I never would have. But I'm just not feeling very motivated this time.[lr]::
42759::$$$message_0350_0000_0013$$$::Her reason being what it is."::
42760::$$$message_0350_0000_0014$$$::"Eh...? Why do you want to go to the onsen?"::
42761::$$$message_0350_0000_0015$$$::"Hey, Archer!"::
42762::$$$message_0350_0000_0016$$$::"Feeling guilty, Rin? Your sister genuinely wants to be happy. She even defeated Shirou Emiya to come this far."::
42763::$$$message_0350_0000_0017$$$::"Imagine how it feels to be in my shoes, getting dragged along for the sake of your diet."::
42764::$$$message_0350_0000_0018$$$::"...Diet?"::
42765::$$$message_0350_0000_0019$$$::"It's rather uncalled-for to put that ahead of Sakura, wouldn't you say? You're always talking about mental flab, but your phys[line len=2][l][se storage=se229.wav][se storage=se231.wav][hffacechg chara=アーチャー face=哀 layer=0 time=200][hfangry layer=0][say storage=HSAK6_ARC_0080 _name=アーチャー]hrrk!"::
42766::$$$message_0350_0000_0020$$$::"...That was a nice right hook."::
42767::$$$message_0350_0000_0021$$$::"...Uhehehehe. So [font italic=true]that's[font italic=false] why you're in my way?"::
42768::$$$message_0350_0000_0022$$$::"That's right, Sakura. You wouldn't understand what it's like to have Shirou say,::
42769::$$$message_0350_0001_0000$$$::[large]'Huh, did you get fatter, Tohsaka?'[rf]::
42770::$$$message_0350_0002_0000$$$::to your face!"::
42771::$$$message_0350_0002_0001$$$::"...I do recall hearing that at dinner the other night."::
42772::$$$message_0350_0002_0002$$$::"FATTER!? You've got it good, Sakura. At least all your nutrients fill you out [font italic=true]proportionally![font italic=false]"::
42773::$$$message_0350_0002_0003$$$::"I-I don't think that has anything to do with this!"::
42774::$$$message_0350_0002_0004$$$::"Hehehe. Fine. Now that you've found out, I'm not holding back."::
42775::$$$message_0350_0002_0005$$$::"Your team spilled everything, though."::
42776::$$$message_0350_0002_0006$$$::"Archer, how long are you going to take a nap? [l][hfchance layer=0][say storage=HSAK6_RIN_0140 _name=凛]Come on, stand up and fight! I can boost you with a Command Spell, if you want."::
42777::$$$message_0350_0002_0007$$$::"Sakura, Rin has lost her mind, but she's serious. We'd better respond in kind."::
42778::$$$message_0350_0002_0008$$$::"It's okay, Rider... I won't lose when I put my heart into it!"::

